Claude Code 2.1.319 (Linux native build) sends no x-claude-code-request-class header, so tap.js also recognises the main turn by a text the node appends to every main-turn system prompt (env ONEDAY_CC_TAP_MATCH), leaving out the quota probe, the title request and prompt suggestions.
--- a/internal/claudetui/tap.js	2026-11-08 17:55:54.689374951 +0800
